{"parse": {"title": "迷思之茧-642801", "pageid": 105860, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"迷思之茧\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/08/Item-640001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"迷思之茧\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>迷思之茧</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#642801</div></div><hr /><div>纠缠的、闪亮的脑海奇想，你曾遗失的，令指尖震颤狂喜的灵感。用于唤起指定闪念，并将对应角色的狂想或解构等级直升至MAX。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">从指尖溜走的美梦，转瞬即逝的灵感，惹人笑，惹人恼，在脑海的深处，引诱着你永远溺死在无限可能的大海。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "迷思之茧"}}